+
+## Agent tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up forms expose `sign_in` and `sign_up` through the
+[declarative WebMCP API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api)
+in supporting browsers. Each tool is available while its page is loaded and
+accepts `username` and `password`. Invoking a tool submits the form through its
+existing client-side API request and returns `{ success, message }` after the
+request completes. Credentials and API tokens are not included in tool results.
+The same result is displayed in the form. Browsers without WebMCP continue to
+use the ordinary form submission handler.
